WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:22.000
Uptake is not the whole nitrogen pathway

00:22.000 --> 00:42.000
A day-night experiment

00:42.000 --> 01:12.000
Darkness does not mean zero uptake

01:12.000 --> 01:48.000
Light responses have a useful range

01:48.000 --> 02:16.000
Temperature is a response curve

02:16.000 --> 02:42.000
Ammonium can suppress nitrate uptake

02:42.000 --> 03:04.000
A second kinetic component

03:04.000 --> 03:20.000
Separate delivery and physiology
